    "scalar_sigma": 1.0,
    "vector_sigma": 1.25,
    "effect_sigma": 1.4,
    "comment": "Smallest margin (in reference between-seed SDs). Margins are max(floor, largest innocuous-perturbation shift UCB). A shift under one seed-to-seed SD is treated as scientifically indistinguishable. Power: every test must pass (intersection-union), so the margin must exceed the CI half-width by ~3 SE; with 60 reference and 60 candidate seeds (SE ~0.18 SD) that requires margins of ~1 SD. Vector (sup over components) and effect (difference of differences) floors are scaled for their extra noise."
  },
